    "content": "<h2>This is me</h2><p>If you’re reading this, you’ve gotten to my blog. This site as a whole serves as a one-stop shop for all my experiences, learnings, and ruminations. </p><p>As a self-professed jack-of-all-trades, I’ve gotten my hands dirty with all sorts of projects, and I’d like to share it all here with you. Learn from what I’ve done, improve upon it, or tell me about ways to make things better. Hopefully, when reading through this, it inspires you to do something similar, and pursue fun projects to share with the world!</p>",
